**Repair note:** When selecting the inbox task under the chosen policy's MIN_WEIGHT_MAX_PRIORITY mode, the agent matched the wrong task by ignoring the WEIGHT sort key. Task `dsfqa0-output-02-r110-f` (WEIGHT=7, PRIORITY=13) satisfies the minimum-weight-first ordering over `dsfqa0-output-02-r110-b` (WEIGHT=13, PRIORITY=8), but the agent wrote the `-b` task's title into both the output filename and the TASK line. This also cascaded into the incorrect TOTAL=822 (using task-b's PRIORITY=8 and WEIGHT=13) instead of the correct TOTAL=434 (using task-f's PRIORITY=13 and WEIGHT=7). Fix: when evaluating MIN_WEIGHT_MAX_PRIORITY, sort candidates by ascending WEIGHT first, then by descending PRIORITY, then by ascending TITLE, and select the first match.